      "created_at": "2015-02-11T00:05:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What if there is no card on top of the deck?&nbsp; Is it like \"reveal\" where there is nothing to reveal?&nbsp; Or is it like \"play\" where you shuffle and play?</p><p>The Last Xarabian</p><p>At the end of the environment turn, put the top card of the villain deck into play.</p><p>Then, put the top card of each hero deck into play in turn order.&nbsp; If a limited card already in play would be put into play, discard that card instead.</p><p>I'm playing against Infinitor and because of Ocular Swarm, his entire deck was revealed, put into play or discarded, so he has nothing.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:42.544Z",
